  "motion": {
    "frames": 120,
    "note": "ours, modelled on Showdown's normal Golisopod idle (a subtle 39-frame breath) and its stance: rest pose = the game's own pose of the Mega (HOME render), fitted bone by bone (spine, head, both claw arms, raised claws, front legs, camera; the model's bind pose is a T-pose). 120 frames = 3.6 s: 3 breaths (spine BREATH deg), the claw arms and the raised upper claws following a beat later (ARM, FOLLOW). Signature claw strike, frames 66-105: the claws thrust forward THRUST deg and up, the upper pincers snap open and shut (SNAP), all eased; drawn per frame (style.fast_frames)"
  },
